title: Living Ink
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

Makes black pigment from algae.

Ordinary black ink gets its black from fossil carbon. Living Ink gets it from waste algae biomass.

Used by [[TOOOT]].

[[Waste = Food]], [[Biological Nutrient]]
